  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Respect for Human Rights by Businesses in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The ARBHR project&lt;/b&gt;, Advancing Respect for Human Rights by Businesses in Uganda aims to increase awareness of human rights responsibilities of business and reduction of human rights abuses, particularly those impacting women, connected to business activities in Uganda.     Its specific commitment is to implement and increase Business and Human Rights (BHR) agenda among its stakeholders (Uganda Government Ministries and Department (MDs), businesses and Civil Society Organisations (CSOs).</narrative>
  </description>
